{"id":"n89859-1-25","stage":1,"title":"얇다 · 薄","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89859-1-25-1","ko":"이 방은 좀 춥네요.","zh":"这个房间有点冷呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방은","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"춥네요.","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"1","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"身体感觉到的气温低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3e797c2fc70618877a9c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89859-1-25-2","ko":"벽이 얇은 편이라 바람이 들어와서 그래요.","zh":"因为墙壁比较薄，风才吹进来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벽이","meaning":"墙壁，墙壁","explanation":"벽：墙壁，墙壁；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"벽","audio":"/audio/a30f11b63eeef594e419.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28231","senseId":"1","lemma":"벽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얇은","meaning":"薄","explanation":"얇다：薄；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"얇다","audio":"/audio/7dbc70519003a2d1bb2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89859","senseId":"1","lemma":"얇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편이라","meaning":"算是","explanation":"편：算是；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"편","audio":"/audio/53cb600fa1af07485c60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71321","senseId":"3","lemma":"편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바람이","meaning":"风","explanation":"바람：风；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어와서","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a30f11b63eeef594","term":"벽","zh":"墙壁，墙壁","audio":"/audio/a30f11b63eeef594e419.mp3","entryId":"28231","definition":"围绕房子或房间周围的部分。","pronunciation":["벽"]},{"id":"7dbc70519003a2d1","term":"얇다","zh":"薄","audio":"/audio/7dbc70519003a2d1bb2d.mp3","entryId":"89859","definition":"厚度不厚。","pronunciation":["얄ː따"]},{"id":"53cb600fa1af0748","term":"편","zh":"算是","audio":"/audio/53cb600fa1af07485c60.mp3","entryId":"71321","definition":"大概属于某一类。","pronunciation":["편"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"风","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"气压的变化或者人类、机器等引起的空气的流动。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/1a78438e8e84b4659e24.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.19,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89859","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.7421,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为墙壁比较薄，风才吹进来的。","这个房间有点冷呢。","哇，真帅！这是您什么时候的样子？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个房间有点冷呢。","哇，真帅！这是您什么时候的样子？","因为墙壁比较薄，风才吹进来的。"],"answer":2}]}
